{
    "title": "MINI DIGITAL",
    "description": "NOTE 1. If you see message \"Your devices are not compatible\"(this refers to the phone, not the watch, the phone does not support the watch face), use Play Store on WEB browser from PC/Laptop or mobile phone. The web version Play Store has a choice of devices - to download the watch face - you need to select a watch.\r\n\r\nNOTE 2. For the correct display of the information - the watch face must be given permission to use the watch sensors. The watch face displays information from the sensors of the watch, the watch face itself does not generate any information. The watch face does not make any changes to system files, does not change any system settings and user settings, only displays information. Does not collect, transmit or receive any outside data.\r\n\r\nNOTE 3. All settings for the watch face are recommended to be performed in the watch !!! The Samsung Wearable app in the latest versions does not work correctly with the watch face settings !!!\r\n\r\nDigital minimal informative watch face for Wear OS watch.\r\nIn the watch face available sports data - steps/distance, complications(data), visible and invisible shortcuts for quick access to apps.\r\n24H time mode format in phone - support distance in kilometers, 12H time mode format in phone - support distance in miles.\r\nIn the watch face settings you can change the complications place, show/hide information and graphic elements.\r\nSome information and graphics elements are disabled by default(you can turn it on in the watch face settings).\r\n\u0421omplication and day of the week support over 100 language packs, other inscriptions in English.\r\nTap zones SETTINGS & RUN APPS use Samsung watch identifiers - APP ID, other watch models may be not work.\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE 4. If you want to see the battery status of your phone in complications - you need to download the application - \"Phone Battery Complication\" in the Play Store.\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.weartools.phonebattcomp\r\nIf you want to see the moon phase, seconds, utc time and world time in complications - you need to download the application - \"complications Suite - Wear OS\" in the Play Store.\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.weartools.weekdayutccomp&hl\r\nIf you want to see the distance traveled, floors, calories burned - you need to download the application - \"Heart Rate Complication\" in the Play Store.\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.weartools.hscomplications\r\nIf you want to see the heart rate data - you need to download the application - \"Heart Rate Complication\" in the Play Store.\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.weartools.heartratecomp\r\nIf you want to see the more information about the weather data in complications - you need to download the application - \"SimpleWeather\" in the Play Store.\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.thewizrd.simpleweather\r\n\r\nAOD mode support main mode watch face.\r\nThank you and have a nice day !!!\r\n\r\nMy telegram channel t.me/freewatchface - here you will find many interesting watch face from developers all the world. The channel is updated every day.\r\nMy other works watch faces - open link in web version Google Play.\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=6225394716469094592\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy.\r\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/crditmr",
    "descriptionHTML": "NOTE 1. If you see message &quot;Your devices are not compatible&quot;(this refers to the phone, not the watch, the phone does not support the watch face), use Play Store on WEB browser from PC/Laptop or mobile phone. The web version Play Store has a choice of devices - to download the watch face - you need to select a watch.<br><br>NOTE 2. For the correct display of the information - the watch face must be given permission to use the watch sensors. The watch face displays information from the sensors of the watch, the watch face itself does not generate any information. The watch face does not make any changes to system files, does not change any system settings and user settings, only displays information. Does not collect, transmit or receive any outside data.<br><br>NOTE 3. All settings for the watch face are recommended to be performed in the watch !!! The Samsung Wearable app in the latest versions does not work correctly with the watch face settings !!!<br><br>Digital minimal informative watch face for Wear OS watch.<br>In the watch face available sports data - steps/distance, complications(data), visible and invisible shortcuts for quick access to apps.<br>24H time mode format in phone - support distance in kilometers, 12H time mode format in phone - support distance in miles.<br>In the watch face settings you can change the complications place, show/hide information and graphic elements.<br>Some information and graphics elements are disabled by default(you can turn it on in the watch face settings).<br>\u0421omplication and day of the week support over 100 language packs, other inscriptions in English.<br>Tap zones SETTINGS &amp; RUN APPS use Samsung watch identifiers - APP ID, other watch models may be not work.<br><br><br>NOTE 4. If you want to see the battery status of your phone in complications - you need to download the application - &quot;Phone Battery Complication&quot; in the Play Store.<br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.weartools.phonebattcomp<br>If you want to see the moon phase, seconds, utc time and world time in complications - you need to download the application - &quot;complications Suite - Wear OS&quot; in the Play Store.<br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.weartools.weekdayutccomp&amp;hl<br>If you want to see the distance traveled, floors, calories burned - you need to download the application - &quot;Heart Rate Complication&quot; in the Play Store.<br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.weartools.hscomplications<br>If you want to see the heart rate data - you need to download the application - &quot;Heart Rate Complication&quot; in the Play Store.<br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.weartools.heartratecomp<br>If you want to see the more information about the weather data in complications - you need to download the application - &quot;SimpleWeather&quot; in the Play Store.<br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.thewizrd.simpleweather<br><br>AOD mode support main mode watch face.<br>Thank you and have a nice day !!!<br><br>My telegram channel t.me/freewatchface - here you will find many interesting watch face from developers all the world. The channel is updated every day.<br>My other works watch faces - open link in web version Google Play.<br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=6225394716469094592<br><br>Privacy policy.<br>https://sites.google.com/view/crditmr",
